<title>SWEDEN: Ave yld 6.65 pct on Swedish nine year bond.</title>
<headline>Ave yld 6.65 pct on Swedish nine year bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of two billion crowns of five-year bonds was 6.65 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			Loan 1038 Volume issued (billions) 1.90</p>
<p>				    Total bids    (billions) 2.10</p>
<p>				    Number of accepted bids  31</p>
<p>				    Number of bids	     36</p>
<p>				    Lowest yields		6.628</p>
<p>				    Highest yields	     6.668</p>
<p>				    Weighted average yield   6.654</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
